'''[[Kyber crystal|Kyber]] mines''' were located on the [[moon]] [[Jedha]].<ref name="Rogue One" /> Rogue [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel]] leader [[Saw Gerrera]] led several attacks on Jedha's mines and cargo shipments. After that, the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Imperial-class Star Destroyer|Star Destroyer]] ''[[Dauntless (Imperial I-class)|Dauntless]]'' was moved over [[Jedha City]] to provide security and serve as a deterrent to further attacks.<ref name="Rogue One" /><ref name="LC">''[[Star Wars: The Lightsaber Collection]]''</ref>

